@startuml
title Tests Page — Прохождение теста

actor User
participant "TestsPage" as Page
participant "TestController" as TC
participant "TestAttempt" as TA
participant "AttemptQuestion" as AQ
participant "DockerRunner" as Docker

User -> Page: click "Начать тест"
Page -> TC: dispatch(startAttempt(testId, userId))
TC -> TA: create(testId, userId, startedAt=now)
TA --> TC: attempt{ id }
TC -> AQ: bulkCreate(attemptId, questions[])
AQ --> TC: attemptQuestions[]
TC --> Page: attempt{ id, questions[], timeLimitSec }
Page --> User: рендер формы прохождения (таймер + вопросы)

User -> Page: выбирает ответы (single-choice / multiple-choice / matching)

alt вопрос с кодом
    User -> Page: вводит код → click "Запустить"
    Page -> TC: dispatch(runCode(code, language, stdinInput?))
    TC -> Docker: runInDocker(language, code)
    Docker --> TC: stdout, stderr, exitCode
    TC --> Page: { output, error }
    Page --> User: вывод кода в консоли
end

User -> Page: click "Завершить тест"
Page -> TC: dispatch(submitAttempt(attemptId, userId, answers[]))
TC -> TA: findByPk(attemptId)
TA --> TC: attempt
TC -> TA: update(attemptId, { finishedAt=now, score, maxScore })
TA --> TC: updatedAttempt
TC --> Page: { score, maxScore, passed: boolean }
Page --> User: рендер экрана результата (баллы, процент)

@enduml
